    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Far Stars is a space-sim with traditional roguelike characteristics like grid-based, turn-based combat and procedural content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an ambitious project with lots of  content that I am working on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760790/extras/d59cc83ae6f24a94e766d07cce7f67c8.avif?t=1749052393\" width=798 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy with 250 stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every star has 1-3 planets to scan or land on and trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets have different kind of atmospheres, landscapes, climate etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every civilized planet has a different kind of economy like industrial, agricultural or tourism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is economy and trade within human faction planets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a pirate faction that attacks trading ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship has a modular upgrade system with thrusters, ftl drive, shields etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are artifacts of a long lost civilization which players can equip to their ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets can be scanned and scanned data can be sold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760790/extras/7993168ca5e3c6681b2f8f82c0de695f.avif?t=1749052393\" width=798 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pilot will be able to walk on the planets and derelicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel extraction from stars and gas giants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien civilizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroid mining.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760790/extras/d7be7408139458696f658bf039be749c.avif?t=1749052393\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
